<section class="mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-5">
  <p>
    Every town has more going on than anyone hears about: the library's
    author talks, the city's festival, the bird walk on Saturday, the
    shelter that needs weekend dog walkers. It's all published — on a dozen
    calendars nobody subscribes to.
  </p>
  <p>
    The event radar reads those calendars for you, and then does the part
    a calendar can't: it says which of it you'd actually go to.
  </p>
</section>

